@startuml sequence_scrub
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Review Goal History - Scrubbing the Slider

actor Owner
participant "Slider" as Sld
participant "Controller" as Ctrl
participant "time helpers" as TH
participant "GoalProgressService" as Svc
participant "API" as API
database "SQL Server" as DB

Owner -> Sld: Drag to 72%
Sld -> Ctrl: scrub(72)
Ctrl -> TH: scrubInstantFromPct(appliedStart, appliedEnd, 72)
TH --> Ctrl: scrubAt (epoch)
Ctrl -> Ctrl: debounce 100ms
Ctrl -> Svc: getAt(goalId, scrubAt)
Svc -> API: GET /api/goal-progress/at?goalId=17&asOf=2026-04-05T19:24Z
API -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*)\n  WHERE GoalId=17 AND ProfileId=@p\n  AND RecordedAt <= @asOf
DB --> API: 19
API --> Svc: { count:19, target:30, asOf }
Svc --> Ctrl: dto
Ctrl --> Sld: tile re-renders ring + count

@enduml
